                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Interesting game. I enjoyed every level. Challenging from the start to the very end!\r\nIn terms of issues - there are only three:\r\n1. You can accidentally lock yourself out of completing the level (there a 3 levels like this)\r\n2. Even though new mechanics are introduced gradually, complexity does not. In the same stage you can have some levels that takes an hour to complete and at the same time have a different level that can be completed in under 5 minutes.\r\n3. Those little comics interludes - they went right over my head. I couldn't understand a single one.\r\nBut these are neglectable. You have to be really unlucky to lock yourself out and the game is interesting not for it's plot but for it's puzzles. And puzzles they have!\r\nAdditional thank you for not making those levels time based. That way you can just chill and solve some puzzles without any additional pressure.\r\nRecommend!",
